\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The controllor has the concept of banks and presets in each bank. I like setting up a home page (or pages) in the controller in a bank. Then each present does a bank jump to another set of presents in a different bank. For example the Ableton Looper preset in Bank 1 jumps to bank 5 which has the ableton presents in one bank. This is generally tbe pattern I like to follow.\
I have a Strymon flint v2, an Strymon EC-2, a Strymon Deco V2, a Boss RC500 looper which are the midi pedals. I also have a morningstar ML5 (first edition) loop switcher https://www.morningstar.io/ml5.\
